+## Import
+
+`POST /groups/:id/import` records a list of expenses and payments for a group in one go: all of them, or none of them.
+
+The body is `{"entries": [...], "dry_run": <boolean>, "skip_recorded": <boolean>}`. `dry_run` and `skip_recorded` may be left out, and are then false. An entry is either an expense `{"type": "expense", "description", "payer", "amount", "split"}`, where `split` may be left out, or a payment `{"type": "payment", "from", "to", "amount"}`. Each field follows the same rule as on `POST /groups/:id/expenses` or `POST /groups/:id/payments`. A field counts as left out only when its key is absent: a present key is checked whatever its value, `null` included.
+
+After the 413 and non-object checks every route has, these checks run in order; the first that fails decides the reply, and a failed check saves nothing:
